<li><a href="/wiki/Software_configuration_management" title="Software configuration management">Software configuration management</a>&#160;– Tracking and controlling software changes</li>
<li><a href="/wiki/WinDiff" title="WinDiff">WinDiff</a>&#160;– File comparison program by Microsoft</li></ul>
</div>
