<li id="cite_note-47"><span class="mw-cite-backlink"><b><a href="#cite_ref-47">^</a></b></span> <span class="reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1238218222" /><cite id="CITEREFNugrohoHataMatsumoto2020" class="citation journal cs1">Nugroho, Yusuf Sulistyo; Hata, Hideaki; Matsumoto, Kenichi (January 2020). <a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://doi.org/10.1007%2Fs10664-019-09772-z">"How different are different diff algorithms in Git?: Use --histogram for code changes"</a>. <i>Empirical Software Engineering</i>: <span class="nowrap">790–</span>823. <a href="/wiki/ArXiv_(identifier)" class="mw-redirect" title="ArXiv (identifier)">arXiv</a>:<span class="id-lock-free" title="Freely accessible"><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://arxiv.org/abs/1902.02467">1902.02467</a></span>. <a href="/wiki/Doi_(identifier)" class="mw-redirect" title="Doi (identifier)">doi</a>:<span class="id-lock-free" title="Freely accessible"><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://doi.org/10.1007%2Fs10664-019-09772-z">10.1007/s10664-019-09772-z</a></span>. <a href="/wiki/S2CID_(identifier)" class="mw-redirect" title="S2CID (identifier)">S2CID</a>&#160;<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://api.semanticscholar.org/CorpusID:59608676">59608676</a>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Empirical+Software+Engineering&amp;rft.atitle=How+different+are+different+diff+algorithms+in+Git%3F%3A+Use+--histogram+for+code+changes&amp;rft.pages=790-823&amp;rft.date=2020-01&amp;rft_id=info%3Aarxiv%2F1902.02467&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fapi.semanticscholar.org%2FCorpusID%3A59608676%23id-name%3DS2CID&amp;rft_id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1007%2Fs10664-019-09772-z&amp;rft.aulast=Nugroho&amp;rft.aufirst=Yusuf+Sulistyo&amp;rft.au=Hata%2C+Hideaki&amp;rft.au=Matsumoto%2C+Kenichi&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdoi.org%2F10.1007%252Fs10664-019-09772-z&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ADiff" class="Z3988"></span></span>
</li>
<li id="cite_note-48"><span class="mw-cite-backlink"><b><a href="#cite_ref-48">^</a></b></span> <span class="reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1238218222" /><cite class="citation web cs1"><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://stackoverflow.com/a/32367597/">"algorithm - What's the difference between 'git diff --patience' and 'git diff --histogram'?"</a>. <i>Stack Overflow</i>. <a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20220219233605/https://stackoverflow.com/questions/32365271/whats-the-difference-between-git-diff-patience-and-git-diff-histogram/32367597">Archived</a> from the original on 2022-02-19<span class="reference-accessdate">. Retrieved <span class="nowrap">2020-06-28</span></span>. <q>This does indeed show that histogram diff slightly beats Myers, while patience is much slower than the others.</q></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=Stack+Overflow&amp;rft.atitle=algorithm+-+What%27s+the+difference+between+%27git+diff+--patience%27+and+%27git+diff+--histogram%27%3F&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fstackoverflow.com%2Fa%2F32367597%2F&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ADiff" class="Z3988"></span></span>
